  "updated_at": "2026-03-28",
  "bio": "David Yates is a highly skilled tattoo artist based in Mentor, United States, who specializes in geometric, newschool, and illustrative styles. His work at AMMONITE TATTOO is not only aesthetically captivating but also reflects a deep reverence for the connection between nature, culture, and the human body. Clients appreciate David's professionalism, as he brings both exceptional artistry and a profound sense of tradition to every piece he creates.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Mentor, Ohio, United States\n\nThe craft at AMMONITE TATTOO is a practice of connection to nature and culture, carried on the always-altar (the body), a form of ancient healing.",
